# Everything below gives the answer key away, in whole or in part. The repository is
# public and people have not taken the trial yet, so these stay out of version control
# until the owner decides otherwise (see README.md, "Keeping the key away from readers",
# and DECISIONS.md, "K1 meaning trial (proxy)"). To publish them, delete the lines.
/key.json
/item_flags.json
/analyst_notes.md
/REPORT.md
/results.json
/responses/
# the same files for any further item bank
/banks/*/key.json
/banks/*/item_flags.json
/banks/*/analyst_notes.md
/banks/*/REPORT.md
/banks/*/results.json
/banks/*/responses/
__pycache__/
